Z||000000||AusFiero||08-09-2001||07:48 AM||||Well this is something I have been toying with for my next Fiero. Features include polished or brush alloy where everything is pictured grey here. Undecided on the plosished or brushed as yet. False flat floors to allow the alloy runners in the front section, redesigned subwoofer console with all the console panels running down to floor level. Left the seats out so it could be viewed. All red sections would be painted to match the cars exterior and carry the theme through for consistency. I may even turn it into a kit someday....A LONG WAY down the track.<P>Yes I did relax today. I drew this. Well finished it anyway.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/interiorretro.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
