Z||000009||Hartz||08-11-2001||09:38 AM||||Aus - this is all a secret attempt to bankrupt me, isn't it?  Do you take payroll deduction?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I didn't even notice the slanted radio pod the first time.  Interesting.  What if you did something like on the Audi TT's and went with the brushed aluminium brace bars in that area?  That way you wouldn't need wiring extensions for the radio and all that, but you could still achieve a "slanted" look?  Just a thought.  <P>Keep up the good work and GET SOME REST FOR PITY'S SAKE!!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Hartz<BR>'84 SC 5.7L V8<BR>'85 SE 3.1L V6 Turbo||||reg||1
